                "text": ".@RoswellPark is leading the charge in cancer prevention and research, bringing hope to patients and families across Western New York and the Southern Tier through their commitment to early detection and innovative programs like EDDY that are making a real difference in our fight against lung cancer. \n\nI'm proud to be their partner at the federal level, advocating for bipartisan legislation that will support their mission by expanding access to life-saving screenings and providing resources for research to advance prevention and treatment.",
