                "text": "Today, I had the opportunity to join @RepBuddyCarter and a bipartisan, bicameral group of my colleagues who are leading the fight for Pharmacy Benefit Manager (PBM) reforms.\n\nPBMs are hurting patients and community pharmacists to maximize their margins \u2014 we need to get back to a system that prioritizes serving patients, not lining the pockets of middlemen.",
